OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1764068036
OL,3,CNew Norwich City boss convinced
OL,4,Cstruggling squad 'not where it should
OL,5,Cbe'
OL,7,FNew Norwich City boss Philippe Clement
OL,8,Fbelieves the struggling squad he has
OL,9,Finherited "has much more potential"
OL,10,Fthan it has shown so far, but
OL,11,Facknowledges there is a "lot of work
OL,12,Fto be done."
OL,14,FDespite being among the pre-season
OL,15,Ffavourites for promotion, the Canaries
OL,16,Fcurrently find themselves in the
OL,17,FChampionship relegation zone - with
OL,18,Fonly crisis-stricken Sheffield
OL,19,FWednesday propping them up from the
OL,20,Fbottom of the table.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31002
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1764068036
OL,3,CNew Norwich City boss convinced
OL,4,Cstruggling squad 'not where it should
OL,5,Cbe'
OL,7,FThat disastrous start to the campaign
OL,8,Fultimately cost former head coach Liam
OL,9,FManning his job, with the club now
OL,10,Fputting their faith in Clement to
OL,11,Fprevent the club sliding into League
OL,12,FOne for the first time since 2009.
OL,14,FThat mission starts away at Birmingham
OL,15,FCity on Saturday, and speaking ahead
OL,16,Fof the trip to St. Andrew's @
OL,17,FKnighthead Park, Clement insisted the
OL,18,Fplayers at his disposal are good
OL,19,Fenough to get out of trouble.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31003
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1764068036
OL,3,CNew Norwich City boss convinced
OL,4,Cstruggling squad 'not where it should
OL,5,Cbe'
OL,7,F"I see that there is much more
OL,8,Fpotential than the club is showing at
OL,9,Fthe moment," he told the media in his
OL,10,Ffirst press conference on Friday.
OL,12,F"It's a process, step by step, that we
OL,13,Fneed to build now. It's like writing a
OL,14,Fbook, we are only writing the first
OL,15,Ffew pages together now. And the book
OL,16,Fis not full.
OL,18,F"I'm very convinced that this squad is
OL,19,Fnot at the place it should be, but
OL,20,Fthere is work to be done, for sure."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31004
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1764068036
OL,3,CNew Norwich City boss convinced
OL,4,Cstruggling squad 'not where it should
OL,5,Cbe'
OL,7,FClement, 51, has been out of work
OL,8,Fsince he was sacked by Scottish giants
OL,9,FRangers in February, and admitted he
OL,10,Fhad been in talks with other teams as
OL,11,Frecently as the last couple of weeks.
OL,13,FHowever, he said he was attracted by
OL,14,Fthe ambition of Norwich after
OL,15,Fextensive talks with the club's
OL,16,Fhierarchy.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31005
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1764068036
OL,3,CNew Norwich City boss convinced
OL,4,Cstruggling squad 'not where it should
OL,5,Cbe'
OL,7,FWhen asked how confident he felt that
OL,8,Fhe could make an immediate impact,
OL,9,FClement insisted that "there will be a
OL,10,Fdifference straight away" but "several
OL,11,Fproblems" still needed to be solved in
OL,12,Forder to truly engineer long-term
OL,13,Fimprovement.
OL,15,F"'The players are not fit enough for
OL,16,Fwhat I want. Or need," he said.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31006
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1764068036
OL,3,CNew Norwich City boss convinced
OL,4,Cstruggling squad 'not where it should
OL,5,Cbe'
OL,7,F"It's now about seeing this season as
OL,8,Fa marathon, it's about where you
OL,9,Ffinish. Nobody's happy with where we
OL,10,Fare. For the moment, I only ask one
OL,11,Fthing now, that I demand from the
OL,12,Fplayers to give their life on the
OL,13,Fpitch."
OL,15,FNorwich are hoping that Clement's
OL,16,Fappointment will help quell growing
OL,17,Ffrustration among the club's fanbase,
OL,18,Fwith supporters staging protests after
OL,19,Fthe Canaries' last two home fixtures.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31007
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1764068036
OL,3,CNew Norwich City boss convinced
OL,4,Cstruggling squad 'not where it should
OL,5,Cbe'
OL,7,FMuch of that anger has been directed
OL,8,Fat under fire Sporting Director Ben
OL,9,FKnapper who has spent #55 million on
OL,10,Fnew players since first arriving at
OL,11,FCarrow Road two years ago, and sacked
OL,12,Fthree head coaches.
OL,14,FHis decision to hire Clement is being
OL,15,Fseen by many as a final roll of the
OL,16,Fdice, and Knapper admitted he was
OL,17,Fsurprised the club were able to entice
OL,18,Fa candidate of the Belgian's calibre.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,311,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31008
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F310A1764068036
OL,3,CNew Norwich City boss convinced
OL,4,Cstruggling squad 'not where it should
OL,5,Cbe'
OL,7,F"Honestly, when we first made initial
OL,8,Fcontact - we felt maybe that it was a
OL,9,Fstretched target," said Knapper.
OL,11,F"He's got a proven track record. He's
OL,12,Fbeen there and done it, and taken over
OL,13,Fteams in this particular situation as
OL,14,Fwell. We've played less than a third
OL,15,Fof the season so there's still a lot
OL,16,Fof football to be played."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
